(4) Any cable television headend or hub towers and antennas used solely for cable television services;
(5) Any radio or television broadcast towers and antennas, whose placement is regulated by Article 7 of the Unified Development Code of Griffin, Georgia.
(Ord. No. 19-04, § 1, 1-22-2019)

